        "note": "Read Theorem 4.10 and its complete proof, Lemma 4.11 parameter-domain control, Proposition 3.9 germ tangent-space calculation, and the singular partial connection/conservation law/path diffeology definitions. The proof explicitly separates finite jets, inverse-limit jets and germs and gives the local representative and plot calculations. Standard parameter-dependent manifold flow existence and invariance of a singular foliation under its own flows are identified prior results. Neither the later hierarchy theorem with proof referred to a prior paper nor the holonomy quotient comparison is selected."
